461	
462	Also **remove** the existing `<style>` block at the bottom of `index.html` (lines 76–101) — it will be replaced by Tailwind classes in Phase 02.
463	
464	### Step 3: Add Tailwind CDN + Config to `game.html`; Remove Bootstrap
